OL,3,AFive EU countries expected to announce
OL,4,Amigrant deportation centre in Rwanda
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is understood the scheme would only
OL,7,Fapply to asylum seekers who had
OL,8,Fexhausted legal avenues to remain in
OL,9,Fthe EU, unlike a scrapped British deal
OL,10,Fthat envisaged sending people to Rwanda
OL,11,Fto have their claims processed.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
