OL,3,AUK and allies call on Israel to allow
OL,4,Arapid humanitarian access to Gaza
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Israeli military authority which
OL,7,Fcontrols the Gaza crossings has said it
OL,8,Fis co-ordinating with the US-led Board
OL,9,Fof Peace and the UN on a winter plan,
OL,10,Fand that 93,000 tents and 8,600 aid
OL,11,Ftrucks with winter supplies had entered
OL,12,Fthe territory.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
